"The RA MCU has some hardware IIC (Inter-Integrated Circuit Bus). I2C id "
"is available corresponding to the RA MCU's I2C number which are I2C(0) as"
" IIC0 and I2C(1) as IIC1. If with no additional parameters, "
"machine.SoftI2C() is called."
